# Workflow Routing

Prefer explicit project skills for specialized workflows:

- For architecture, feature design, workflow design, or mode/API design, use `.cursor/skills/system-design/SKILL.md`.
- For reviewing a plan or design before implementation, use `.cursor/skills/design-review/SKILL.md`.
- For implementing an approved plan, use `.cursor/skills/develop-by-plan/SKILL.md`.
- For reviewing staged changes, implementation quality, regressions, tests, or plan fulfillment, use `.cursor/skills/code-review/SKILL.md`.

Keep this rule as routing guidance only. Load the matching skill for the detailed workflow.
